scripts.translation:
{0}
佔據{1}的公會是{2}。
看起來不是您的公會。

scripts.text:
{0}
Is that so?
Please come back whenever you are interested in investing in the Abyss Gate development.

scripts.translation:
{0}
是嗎？
如果您有興趣投資深淵之門開發，請隨時回來。

scripts.text:
{0}
